fix: stamp dependency index rows with the packages they lead into and keep no unresolved rows

A warm run answered a re-exported package's types from rows stamped with only the importing
package's package.json, so upgrading the target kept the old props and installing a missing
package never resolved. Rows now record the other packages they depend on, a chain is only as
current as its newest link, and unresolved imports are not persisted.

